WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You choose one of two cards.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Imagine the card returned is not the one you selected.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Would you notice before explaining why?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Choice blindness investigates that mismatch. It says nothing about meditation products.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before reading an offer, write down what you need and can verify.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the source. Try a free baseline. Check six questions before buying.
